Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.18,0:00:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.46,0:00:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.76,0:00:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get what you really want.\NI want more. Any one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.70,0:00:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.36,0:00:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.66,0:00:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a winter fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.52,0:00:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.66,0:00:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.20,0:00:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.46,0:00:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.42,0:00:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it again. You\Nno gonna need you, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.50,0:00:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can make you my dream come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.12,0:00:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel it? I\Nreally don't know what is?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is testing me every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:01:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I never wanna come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away. The great\Nend of the unknown rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.68,0:01:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing up, blowing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream is getting wilder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.70,0:01:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid, beat me, hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.70,0:01:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Another day, another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's never too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.14,0:01:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can do it, so can you. Only without.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.42,0:01:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.56,0:01:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Party for tomorrow. Go\Nget what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.66,0:01:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more,\Ncome on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a wind, jump high, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.78,0:01:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.14,0:01:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. Roaring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.16,0:01:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.42,0:01:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for your eyes that\NI want, but your weary ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more,\Ncome on, open up the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:02:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life,\Nshine like a star to be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.62,0:02:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong. Just that\Nyou can't achieve your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.34,0:02:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. Out of day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.62,0:02:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You make my day every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.48,0:02:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Three days have passed\Nsince the battle ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.34,0:02:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,between the Straw Hats and\Nthe Don Quixote family.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.02,0:02:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Straw Hat Loopy still\Nhiding out in this kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.26,0:02:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.06,0:02:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.96,0:02:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.60,0:03:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Esau, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.34,0:03:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard about your spat with Sakazuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.68,0:03:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad I'm not fleet admiral anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.40,0:03:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut it. Just eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.52,0:03:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not much else for you\Nto do as Inspector General.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.44,0:03:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Admiral Fujitora, why haven't\Nyou seized that pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.12,0:03:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You've confirmed that he's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.24,0:03:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy, the hero of Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.78,0:03:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Since he's a wanted man,\Nshould I bring him in?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.28,0:03:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Or let him walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.50,0:03:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he saved this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.98,0:03:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The decision weighs heavily on my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.04,0:03:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.62,0:03:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no laughing matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.42,0:03:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.80,0:04:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's quite enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.32,0:04:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.58,0:04:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool, and you, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.58,0:04:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.08,0:04:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If Straw Hat's an ordinary man, would\NProvidence spare him two days in a row?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.82,0:04:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's the third day, and I\Nhaven't cheated a single time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.26,0:04:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You, sober, now! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.70,0:04:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming right up, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.44,0:04:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate your help with\Ntransporting the heavenly demon,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.52,0:04:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but this island is still\Nunder my jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.76,0:04:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll handle things my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.56,0:04:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine by me, but the Navy can't just let\Nhim run amok forever, not with that bounty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.38,0:04:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you be down to donors?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.26,0:04:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Navy officers, please,\Nhelp us, we need you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.64,0:04:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you're back again, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.92,0:04:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.76,0:05:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you adorable?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.38,0:05:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A dwarf they call you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.12,0:05:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Mon Cherie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.82,0:05:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm from the Tintata tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.40,0:05:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, how cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.52,0:05:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, that's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.72,0:05:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.84,0:05:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You better show some respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.42,0:05:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the daughter of\Nthe great chief Tanta.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.56,0:05:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,which means you're meeting\Nour princess. Now bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.50,0:05:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Bow before her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Mauji. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.36,0:05:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, she's so merciful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.16,0:05:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, truthfully,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.92,0:05:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,our people aren't supposed\Nto let ourselves be seen by
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.22,0:05:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,anyone in Dressrosa who isn't\Na member of the royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.76,0:05:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So I was hoping I'd be able to heal\Neveryone's injuries discreetly. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.46,0:05:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.42,0:05:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.70,0:05:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've been waiting\Nfor this day forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.06,0:06:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So have I.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.30,0:06:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it away, Gats. We're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.88,0:06:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Gats.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.02,0:06:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, thank\Nyou all for being here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.30,0:06:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, this day is one that\Nwill go down in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.06,0:06:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Because, as you know, our\Nking is returning to power.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.86,0:06:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.54,0:06:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,After an entire decade, our\NKing Rick the Third is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.60,0:06:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So give it up for him, Dressrosa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.68,0:06:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.74,0:06:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick! King Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.52,0:06:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.46,0:06:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.98,0:06:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This kingdom is mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.14,0:06:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That pirate fooled them,\Nmade them hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.32,0:07:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They allowed themselves to be\Nseduced by wealth and violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.74,0:07:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Only when they experienced the\Nfear of death did they finally
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.16,0:07:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,come to their senses and wish\Nfor this land to be peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.50,0:07:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a farce, but I can't laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.62,0:07:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.58,0:07:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, I'm happy they're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.46,0:07:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I wonder if I'll be able\Nto make them happy as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.96,0:07:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Were I a god, I'd prevent any danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.78,0:07:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing would harm them. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.48,0:07:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.39,0:07:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you sound like you've gone mad, hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.38,0:07:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.62,0:07:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We will continue our efforts after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.06,0:08:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What more can we do indeed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.16,0:08:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides the day will come when?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.96,0:08:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,when Rebecca inherits the crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.96,0:08:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.92,0:08:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that thought scare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.22,0:08:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, back when Scarlet was a young\Ngirl, she was quite the firecracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.74,0:08:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What if Rebecca leaves as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.30,0:08:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.80,0:08:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There you're all set, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.88,0:08:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How lovely, a dress suits you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.78,0:08:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Much better than that old armor of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.70,0:08:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.80,0:08:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.76,0:08:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're beautiful lady, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.62,0:08:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.04,0:09:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,When you wear that dress, I swear\Nyou look exactly like your mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.16,0:09:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.56,0:09:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and we've heard\Ntalk about your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.32,0:09:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.23,0:09:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a prince from some far away land.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.54,0:09:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And rumor has it, that\Nprince and your mother
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.58,0:09:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,eloped.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.49,0:09:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, King Rick had no choice but\Nto tell everyone that Lady Scarlet was
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.88,0:09:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.79,0:09:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like something from a romance novel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.00,0:09:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes me swoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.06,0:09:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a prince? From where?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.52,0:09:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Not sure, but from the rumors I've heard,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.16,0:09:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a luxurious kingdom\Nwith beautiful lakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.04,0:09:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, his land was at war back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.24,0:09:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So she and this guy ran off,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and after that, baby\NRebecca was born. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.46,0:09:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, the prince\Nwas killed in the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.62,0:10:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that just terrible?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.66,0:10:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So Lady Scarlet and Rebecca,\NI mean, Lady Rebecca,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.14,0:10:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,ended up living undercover in Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.30,0:10:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.60,0:10:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Her dad was a prince, so her\Nblood's still 100 % noble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.56,0:10:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What a bizarre rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.40,0:10:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We know for certain that Sir Kiros\Nis the maiden's father, do we not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.60,0:10:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm at a loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.84,0:10:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, have some lettuce.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.88,0:10:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This toy soldier is brave and true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.88,0:10:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,In the rain or in the snow,\Nhe will stay with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.16,0:10:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.34,0:11:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They're distributing Lady\NMoncheree's medicinal flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.28,0:11:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They're wondrous and\Nproving to be very useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.26,0:11:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Get in line. Wait your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.80,0:11:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,One per person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.42,0:11:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.34,0:11:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This medicine is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.50,0:11:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It heals injuries up lickety-split.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.76,0:11:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.34,0:11:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.94,0:11:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Dad, I got you one. Thanks, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.04,0:11:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.86,0:11:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, gone in a flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.20,0:11:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.80,0:11:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How lucky am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.48,0:12:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.80,0:12:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, sir. For sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.94,0:12:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.00,0:12:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're able to use donors to\Nenhance your healing capability.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.52,0:12:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of the heal-heal\Nfruit really is something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.10,0:12:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, I'd be glad to donate as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.82,0:12:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, go ahead and take enough\Nto patch up ten wounded people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.64,0:12:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's generous\Nof you. That's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.02,0:12:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do fifteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.64,0:12:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.55,0:12:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll give\Nyou enough for twenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.10,0:12:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Put me down for twenty-five.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.40,0:12:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, then make it a hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.10,0:12:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a bit much, but thank you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.02,0:12:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.72,0:12:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let you have the honor\Nof rolling the dice today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.24,0:13:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's anything but one, then we move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.86,0:13:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll go after Straw\NHat and Law immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.68,0:13:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Apologies for the delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.08,0:13:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, they carried on and on\Nabout Lady Rebecca's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.82,0:13:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe they were suggesting he\Nwas a prince from some foreign land.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.80,0:13:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, there it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.70,0:13:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's a strange story.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.66,0:13:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm sad because Zubo's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.18,0:13:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta hurry and catch\Nup with Zubo's group, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.12,0:13:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be hungry and angry and crying\Nand sleepy at the same time, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.78,0:14:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Make up your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.18,0:14:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but that old soldier\Ndude is Rebecca's real dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.88,0:14:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't fully recovered yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.40,0:14:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop stuffing your face and lie down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.76,0:14:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would make up something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.54,0:14:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the person who\Ngot that rumor started.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.78,0:14:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.36,0:14:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The only ones who know the truth\Nare some of the royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.82,0:14:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and those of the Don Quixote\Nfamily who dug into my past.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.08,0:14:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The kingdom knows her mother,\Nbut little more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.42,0:14:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I spread that story before they could
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.82,0:14:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,find out that Rebecca is my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.14,0:14:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.10,0:14:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.60,0:14:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because of my past.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.42,0:14:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.66,0:14:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And someone of my low breeding\Ncould never marry royalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.58,0:15:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.36,0:15:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,better for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.68,0:15:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.00,0:15:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Does Rebecca know about all this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.76,0:15:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She must have read my note.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.56,0:15:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I told her the honest\Ntruth about my whole life
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.52,0:15:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,because of what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.40,0:15:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca suffered for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.44,0:15:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I want her to live in the light forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.60,0:15:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And that means she can't\Nhave anything to do with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.50,0:15:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way I can make\Namends for failing as her father.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.70,0:15:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,When you leave this place, I'm\Nthinking of leaving as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.02,0:15:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She may resent my choice,\Nbut she's still a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.50,0:15:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And I won't let her life be ruined\Nover a temporary fit of emotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.24,0:15:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick understands and agrees with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.34,0:16:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we know how Luffy feels about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.12,0:16:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.46,0:16:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.46,0:16:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I mean, Sir Kuros!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.06,0:16:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, Leo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.68,0:16:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.82,0:16:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.73,0:16:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I didn't know you was awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.30,0:16:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What an honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.38,0:16:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How's your morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.76,0:16:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Five straw-head pirates in the same place?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.36,0:16:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And do we have mercy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.66,0:16:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a laser beam of\Nawesomeness is burning my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.41,0:16:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If I ever saw your whole crew\Nof all-stars at the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.94,0:16:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.36,0:16:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd probably piss myself and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.62,0:16:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you please just say\Nwhat you came here to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.22,0:16:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.60,0:16:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There's been some movement\Nover at the Navy tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.22,0:17:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I think they might come this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.84,0:17:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Zuru's with them, and\Nthe old Fleet Admiral Sengoku too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.94,0:17:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Saru and Sengoku?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.62,0:17:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd they sit in a couple\Nof big guns like them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.38,0:17:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.04,0:17:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sengoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.24,0:17:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo, why were you calling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.22,0:17:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the Navy's getting\Nready to attack you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.24,0:17:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So, it's a six, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.92,0:17:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Providence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.98,0:17:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,All troops, advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.04,0:17:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Find the Straw Hats and\NLaw, and then capture them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.02,0:17:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, arrest every criminal\Nthat's within the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.40,0:17:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's bring all of them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.32,0:17:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Admiral, we can't invade.\NYou need clearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.34,0:17:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You do your job and I'll do mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.66,0:17:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take full responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.72,0:17:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.90,0:18:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They're on their way now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.32,0:18:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to prepare quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.80,0:18:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Our luck has run out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.58,0:18:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing left to prepare.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.02,0:18:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We ensured we were ready\Nto escape days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.34,0:18:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We were waiting for Sir Luffy to awaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.16,0:18:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, though it worked in our favor,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.48,0:18:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I must admit it was strange that\Nthey didn't come for us earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.70,0:18:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There's just one problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.22,0:18:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We are in need of a vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.12,0:18:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That means we're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.96,0:18:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not getting anywhere without a ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.44,0:18:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Leo, have you carried\Nout the request I made?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.48,0:18:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.66,0:18:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I followed your\Ninstructions to the letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.00,0:18:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.91,0:19:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.10,0:19:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here to capture pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.10,0:19:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.36,0:19:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, they'll get Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.82,0:19:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.86,0:19:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of the Marines are\Nheading up to the palace, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.98,0:19:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All of the fighters will need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.22,0:19:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, thanks for your concern, little pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.04,0:19:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.20,0:19:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,we've been keeping an eye out for\Nthe Navy ourselves this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.40,0:19:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.26,0:19:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.98,0:19:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna make a beeline\Nfor the port in the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.02,0:19:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We knew you'd be ready to skip town\Nas soon as everybody was awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.58,0:19:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So our people are set up in\Nstrategic places to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.14,0:19:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They've been on standby for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.90,0:19:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll clear a path for you easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.54,0:19:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, there's a ship\Nwaiting at the eastern port.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.42,0:19:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, you're a lifesaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.54,0:19:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We let Nami's group take the Sunny,\Nso we were in kind of a bind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.24,0:19:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything for yous guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.68,0:20:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We all fought together as a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.18,0:20:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You think we'd just roll over and\Nlet them take our star player away?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.68,0:20:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Bellamy, can you walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.88,0:20:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.79,0:20:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Or run if I need to.\NAll right. Good to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.84,0:20:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar, why didn't you\Nleave me to my fate back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.86,0:20:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, I lost my place to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.02,0:20:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat said that you were a\Nfriend of his, so I carried you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.16,0:20:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Die here if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.10,0:20:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that those tiny people have patched\Nme up, it's like I was never injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.42,0:20:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So what makes you think I'm gonna be\Nkilled off by a run-in with the damn Navy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.22,0:20:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And find another way to die, dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.92,0:20:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.16,0:20:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty stupid\Nway of saying thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.82,0:20:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.08,0:20:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no more time for a chit-chat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.06,0:20:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to start hauling some ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.72,0:21:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, comrades!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.26,0:21:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Found them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.17,0:21:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let those pirates get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.36,0:21:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.56,0:21:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I got just the thing. Period!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.22,0:21:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let up. Fire! I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.58,0:21:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody follow me, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.02,0:21:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't want to get\Nsnapped up by Fujitora!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.08,0:21:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stick together no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.48,0:21:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Mr. Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.48,0:21:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys can go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.08,0:21:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I got something I need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.62,0:21:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.54,0:21:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have a lot of time here, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.42,0:21:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So whatever it is, make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.24,0:21:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll wait for you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.90,0:21:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, see ya. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.18,0:22:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, you're running to the south, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.44,0:22:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.35,0:22:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But somehow you still\Nlook whoops. What? Lucy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.34,0:22:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, they're about to set\Nsail to escape from the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.64,0:22:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, they can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.16,0:22:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't had a chance to say thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.40,0:22:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Could today be the day\Nhis luck finally runs out?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.24,0:22:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Fate's protected him from my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.58,0:22:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.46,0:22:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,From this point on, instead of\NYisho, I'm commanding all units.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.50,0:22:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And I want you to keep tracking down the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.60,0:22:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,criminals who were\Nhidden inside the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.70,0:22:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.16,0:22:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Straw Hat's group who were\Nseen running from the hill in Karta?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.64,0:22:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just follow the flag, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.20,0:23:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Mr. Sniper King?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.22,0:23:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're even cool when you fall down!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.70,0:23:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure it's safe to run straight\Nthrough the town with Marines everywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.30,0:23:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Would I lie to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.76,0:23:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep running and trust me, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.24,0:23:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We're pursuing the pirates as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.64,0:23:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like they're making\Ntheir way to the eastern port.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.54,0:23:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.84,0:23:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Get that port on the line now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.44,0:23:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.35,0:23:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You've reached the Navy lookout unit\Ncurrently stationed at the eastern port.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.80,0:23:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.74,0:23:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's good here. Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.98,0:23:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.54,0:23:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Would it kill you to\Ntake this more seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.28,0:23:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The pirates are headed\Nstraight towards you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.18,0:23:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.20,0:23:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all quiet on our end.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.82,0:23:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bother sending backup over.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.34,0:23:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.50,0:23:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me your name and your marine code.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.88,0:23:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.79,0:24:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, let's see, damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.78,0:24:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, they've taken control\Nof the eastern port.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.26,0:24:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Send in some reinforcements. Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.28,0:24:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Head straight to the port.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.94,0:24:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We can cover for you. Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.46,0:24:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't waste our time\Non that thank you crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.94,0:24:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We owe you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.70,0:24:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be paying you back for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.26,0:24:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, a rope block?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.62,0:24:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,All clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.53,0:24:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.76,0:24:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We've located the criminals who were\Nsupposed to be at the Royal Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.62,0:24:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,but for some reason they're\Nall in the middle of town, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.14,0:24:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.05,0:25:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,wait a second are you telling me that the
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.78,0:25:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,palace is empty. We're in\Nfront of the I found us!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.92,0:25:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.16,0:25:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.00,0:25:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Fireworks!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.34,0:25:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.25,0:25:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.17,0:25:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, tell me where you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.60,0:25:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What is Straw Hat doing in\Nfront of the royal palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.56,0:25:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not let him get away! Right! Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.70,0:25:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.60,0:25:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Huh? Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.32,0:25:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody's calling for me, but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.54,0:26:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy? Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.82,0:26:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.38,0:26:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.28,0:26:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.22,0:26:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't speak to him, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.76,0:26:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a filthy pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.70,0:26:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.64,0:26:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.62,0:26:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to summon Viola and\NRebecca for me, please. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.60,0:26:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll address the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.58,0:26:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And declare that my family and I\Nwill be returning to the throne,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.72,0:26:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,if that's what they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.00,0:26:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Gladly, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.18,0:26:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been looking forward\Nto this day for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.20,0:26:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.68,0:26:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy, I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.12,0:26:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.16,0:26:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Strata, what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.92,0:26:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Please get back, Lady Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.42,0:26:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What a relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.98,0:27:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still here!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.28,0:27:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I wanted to say thank you for...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.04,0:27:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.04,0:27:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the reason why I came!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.28,0:27:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay with all of this? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.46,0:27:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldier, I mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.52,0:27:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna leave forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.16,0:27:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the thing is, he sent me a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.66,0:27:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like he's trying to put as much\Ndistance between him and me as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.74,0:27:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants us to be strangers from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.54,0:27:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.80,0:27:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop acting like you're my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.70,0:27:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be because of the\Nterrible things I said to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.08,0:27:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't beat the flamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.86,0:27:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.40,0:28:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a broken toy with one leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.54,0:28:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think he doesn't\Nwant us to live together?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.00,0:28:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm just a nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.44,0:28:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Beats me, not my call!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.46,0:28:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I just came to ask if you're\Nfine with him leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.86,0:28:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So tell me, cause I gotta\Nget out of this kingdom too!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.20,0:28:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.84,0:28:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not okay at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.44,0:28:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Then come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.56,0:28:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.56,0:28:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.16,0:28:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Straw Hat, Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.48,0:28:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Viola!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.39,0:28:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a favor from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.92,0:28:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking off!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.26,0:29:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't let go! I'm trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.88,0:29:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.82,0:29:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.68,0:29:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.44,0:29:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.58,0:29:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Rebecca's been\Ncarried away by a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.44,0:29:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.24,0:29:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What was his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.68,0:29:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.76,0:29:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.72,0:29:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Was he a warrior from the Coliseum?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.32,0:29:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, it...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.68,0:29:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It was...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.02,0:29:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It was Straw Hat Luffy, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.20,0:29:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,A man just came to the palace\Nand kidnapped Lady Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.36,0:29:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure it was Straw\NHat Luffy, right? I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.12,0:29:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He's probably taking her\Nfor ransom, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.10,0:29:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But that can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.76,0:29:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy, it doesn't sound like him at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.86,0:29:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there's a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.42,0:29:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.22,0:29:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I still love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.02,0:29:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying? You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.14,0:30:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what happens when you\Ntrust pirates to do as they please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.76,0:30:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go capture Straw Hat and return\Nthe princess to the palace safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.94,0:30:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.30,0:30:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Special sniper unit,\Ntake your shot, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.64,0:30:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, they collapsed out of nowhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.74,0:30:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It knocked them down, conquerors Haki!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.74,0:30:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, looks like they're\Nstill conscious regardless.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.00,0:30:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The pirates are about to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.90,0:30:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I want battle ships in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.86,0:30:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Send all of our forces east to Korta, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.68,0:31:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.42,0:31:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.28,0:31:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.19,0:31:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my dinner! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.78,0:31:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.94,0:31:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna drop you off at the hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.06,0:31:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll lure them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.76,0:31:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you run for it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.54,0:31:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like everybody's\Non the lookout for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.90,0:31:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If you get caught, they'll\Ntake you back to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.34,0:31:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Red, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.40,0:31:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We better hurry, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.94,0:31:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how long you'll stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.40,0:32:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything\Nyou've done, Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.88,0:32:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.10,0:32:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad it worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.22,0:32:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.02,0:32:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.32,0:32:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.20,0:32:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Scarlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.32,0:32:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I fulfilled my duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.94,0:32:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me for cooking up\Na lie about our marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.06,0:32:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want Rebecca to live a happy life.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.08,0:33:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Safe from my past.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.30,0:33:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to learn to defend yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.94,0:33:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother said I shouldn't\Nhurt others no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.78,0:33:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But you must protect yourself\Nfrom those who would hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.94,0:33:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up, child.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.16,0:33:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.40,0:33:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're a member\Nof the royal family,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.02,0:33:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,you've had to endure the hatred of\Nthis nation for an entire decade.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.00,0:33:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But this time, it will be different.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.10,0:33:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You can live the life\Nyou were meant to lead,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.14,0:33:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,a peaceful one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.58,0:34:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not a world\Nthat I can be a part of.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.64,0:34:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.14,0:34:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you lie to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.32,0:34:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.62,0:34:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.40,0:34:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I have a terrible history.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.68,0:34:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a sorry excuse for a man\Nalways getting into fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.18,0:34:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And I was a killer, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.10,0:34:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't deny what I've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.50,0:34:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the honest truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.04,0:34:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, but why did you say I\Nwas the daughter of some prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.78,0:34:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's such a hateful lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.18,0:34:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter how many\Npeople he may have killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.30,0:34:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,or how much his hands\Nare tainted in blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.58,0:35:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I only have one father.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.06,0:35:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm proud to say I'm\Nthe daughter of Karoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.68,0:35:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So you don't have to lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.12,0:35:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Happiness will return to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.94,0:35:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Till then, I'll stay by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.70,0:35:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.92,0:35:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You promised, soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.20,0:35:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Even after all the things that I've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.88,0:35:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's live together.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.08,0:35:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.48,0:36:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, father, but it seems\NRebecca won't be coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.54,0:36:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.88,0:36:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.62,0:36:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.53,0:36:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,She made her own decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.74,0:36:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Viola, I'm sorry, but\Nplease take my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.70,0:36:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Viola.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.54,0:36:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.20,0:36:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean as princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.92,0:36:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I've had to\Ngrant such a request twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.24,0:36:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca really is just\Nlike her mother, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.92,0:36:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy isn't here yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.66,0:36:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen Law anywhere either.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.28,0:36:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the ones who are\Nsupposed to be running this show.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.42,0:36:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Our group is pretty tough, but what\Nif the Navy brings out the big guns?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.52,0:37:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.78,0:37:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,FUCHI Dorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.26,0:37:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot, we're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.42,0:37:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Mr. Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.40,0:37:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What now? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.54,0:37:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one option.
